WEBVTT

00:00:58.511 --> 00:01:01.574
language, art, music

00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:03.079
and self-decoration.

00:01:03.591 --> 00:01:05.224
After the Great Leap Forward,

00:01:05.248 --> 00:01:09.584
there was an explosion
of stone toolmaking,

00:01:09.608 --> 00:01:12.035
more sophisticated weaponry

00:01:12.059 --> 00:01:15.202
and, 32,000 years ago,

00:01:15.226 --> 00:01:21.946
the creation of our first sophisticated
mark-making on the cave walls of Lascaux.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:27.562
It's not a coincidence that we've gone
from documenting our reality

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:30.033
on the cave walls of Lascaux